## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Probe SV (late)
## Notes: SavedVariables cold-start companion to ForeverProbe, WITHOUT LoadSavedVariablesFirst. Reported by /fprobe cold.
## X-SVVariant: Late
## SavedVariables: ForeverProbeSV_LateDB, ForeverProbeSV_LateClobber, ForeverProbeSV_LateOrInit
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverProbeSV_LateChar, ForeverProbeSV_LateCharClobber, ForeverProbeSV_LateCharOrInit

# Directives must stay contiguous: a blank line between two ## lines ends the
# header and the client ignores everything after it.
#
# Deliberately NO `## LoadSavedVariablesFirst` line: this is the control for
# ForeverProbeSV_First, which differs from this header by that one line. No
# dependency on ForeverProbe, on purpose: a dependency would change load order,
# which is the thing being measured.
#
# Core.lua is byte-identical in both variants; Init.lua differs only in names.
Core.lua
Init.lua
